From: Li Guan <guanli.oerv@isrc.iscas.ac.cn>
Subject: [PATCH] Report the application version independently of its logging provider

Read the version from the application package. A separately packaged logging
bridge has its own implementation version.

Signed-off-by: Li Guan <guanli.oerv@isrc.iscas.ac.cn>
---
--- a/src/org/probatron/officeotron/Driver.java
+++ b/src/org/probatron/officeotron/Driver.java
@@ -79,7 +79,7 @@
     			System.out.println( "arguments: [--errors-only] [--schema <schema.xsd>] ]file1 ..." );
     			return;
             } else if ( args[i].equals("--version") ) {
-                String versionStr = logger.getClass().getPackage().getImplementationVersion();
+                String versionStr = Driver.class.getPackage().getImplementationVersion();
                 System.out.println(versionStr);
                 return;
     		} else if ( args[i].equals("--schema") && i+1 < args.length ) {
